{"author":"cursor[bot]","body":"### Perps route not cleared when pendingRedirectRoute takes precedence\n\n**Medium Severity**\n\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION START --\u003e\nWhen `pendingRedirectRoute` is truthy, `checkLastVisitedPerpsRoute` returns early without calling `clearLastVisitedPerpsRoute`, contradicting the JSDoc claim that \"the saved entry is always cleared after inspection.\" Since `checkPendingRedirectRoute` runs first in `componentDidMount` and clears `pendingRedirectRoute` asynchronously, the props haven't updated yet when `checkLastVisitedPerpsRoute` executes — so it skips clearing. The `componentDidUpdate` guard (`lastVisitedPerpsRoute \u0026\u0026 !prevProps.lastVisitedPerpsRoute`) also won't re-trigger because the value was already non-null. This leaves a stale perps route that can hijack the next home mount within the TTL window.\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION END --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: b77e4a1d-9197-492e-a97f-650f738c05d5 --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- LOCATIONS START\nui/pages/home/home.component.js#L254-L257\nui/pages/home/home.component.js#L352-L356\nLOCATIONS END --\u003e\n\u003cdetails\u003e\n\u003csummary\u003eAdditional Locations (1)\u003c/summary\u003e\n\n- [`ui/pages/home/home.component.js#L352-L356`](https://github.com/MetaMask/metamask-extension/blob/285ea9e1958aa5698a5faa075c3712e1c539c88a/ui/pages/home/home.component.js#L352-L356)\n\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/open?data=eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCIsImtpZCI6ImJ1Z2JvdC12MiJ9..Nv5l8ll2bAb6S3SAu6i4EQ5qE5q_7mqQNCd-ROFcXEWUyy-NgWx2eIn1ZF8kJWsmq4sGqZlefgJ6sEBYVcVMRb_wdFaXDDuRszMtZ_SrdQxbpHYkU-MRFuwO89dBe4l9CFYaIVIkqaNHW6E46_tfPhoQwGmIv0j47sC4Q-D9MUyT1wlfHhHqTAEc3diSeFr5hZglgvN00YfuNrdY-377ql5TfKjVOiU-Y1nji8jTSpRXxXby8k5Ih687A1rW3vC1L4vJcCRyFHbhrUPWzJ0XRiVbjxgaCDx6hG9exbFpzZcxe0xdH147yO8UMIRVCtaQK39HXPM7aLmclXGwZVth1w\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset