{"author":"cursor[bot]","body":"### Warning shown to user for fire-and-forget persistence\n\n**Low Severity**\n\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION START --\u003e\n`setLastVisitedPerpsRoute` calls `dispatch(displayWarning(error))` before rethrowing. `PerpsLayout` catches the thrown error silently, but the warning dispatch already happened, setting `appState.warning`. This surfaces a user-visible warning for an operation explicitly documented as \"fire-and-forget — persistence failure should not break Perps.\" Compare with nearby `setDefaultHomeActiveTabName` which simply swallows errors with a no-op catch.\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION END --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 62817026-4552-4e8c-8766-6459dc41f7c6 --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- LOCATIONS START\nui/store/actions.ts#L4329-L4333\nui/pages/perps/perps-layout.tsx#L37-L44\nLOCATIONS END --\u003e\n\u003cdetails\u003e\n\u003csummary\u003eAdditional Locations (1)\u003c/summary\u003e\n\n- [`ui/pages/perps/perps-layout.tsx#L37-L44`](https://github.com/MetaMask/metamask-extension/blob/285ea9e1958aa5698a5faa075c3712e1c539c88a/ui/pages/perps/perps-layout.tsx#L37-L44)\n\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/open?data=eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCIsImtpZCI6ImJ1Z2JvdC12MiJ9..uZtzmc48cRPr1DwTnJd-8cYxWp19ySGECtwK0GAN6obyxRQyyj0fMx1FX6TCZVXQaCOzLL7TxfSlV2YJbFepszCuIOTcjGWxytRhIGRHoR9xldVPAdKRx7UVVddRUCb_8iEQ9BN3JRdqcX01vHqeNeqdbg1qBpxFqRm6VnkPGGeeoMyMJzp5_REPsDnWyhf1yWVLZ4lbqbcHVcgqOOjNqDOrn4Zntv1JKFylJYGXbQG86zh_AcwI1u4YvdfBwTMlnLq5MO9aHc9c9RwxrUUe4suPYe7LzugQ8J3W4lTs3894F0s94FYWY1pFBUI1n1m0jqaOtJeRypT66Ll_YBDmnA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Fix in Cursor\" width=\"115\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor