{"author":"cursor[bot]","body":"### Race condition bounces user back to perps on in-app navigation\n\n**High Severity**\n\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION START --\u003e\nWhen a user navigates from perps to home in-app, `Home.componentDidMount` calls `checkLastVisitedPerpsRoute` and reads a stale non-null `lastVisitedPerpsRoute` from Redux, triggering a redirect back to perps. The `PerpsLayout` cleanup that clears this value runs in a `useEffect` (passive effect phase), which React schedules **after** `componentDidMount` of newly mounted components. Even when the cleanup eventually fires, `setLastVisitedPerpsRoute(null)` is an async thunk round-tripping through `submitRequestToBackground`, so Redux isn't updated before `Home` acts on it. This creates an inescapable loop where the user is always bounced back to perps.\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION END --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 152bbe29-96d3-4410-8a27-0f55a76e2b37 --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- LOCATIONS START\nui/pages/home/home.component.js#L278-L284\nui/pages/perps/perps-layout.tsx#L106-L113\nLOCATIONS END --\u003e\n\u003cdetails\u003e\n\u003csummary\u003eAdditional Locations (1)\u003c/summary\u003e\n\n- [`ui/pages/perps/perps-layout.tsx#L106-L113`](https://github.com/MetaMask/metamask-extension/blob/969480642d687a41ab4441a3760656a0327790ee/ui/pages/perps/perps-layout.tsx#L106-L113)\n\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/open?data=eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCIsImtpZCI6ImJ1Z2JvdC12MiJ9..JBnjrr0fRdClpb7n3fHGK8vCJw9GF1AvEe7dAd_cvVNh_--7vGKVhefXYRe9ALtChx1OCBXr_6svGZY2_Z6t_kBUXZ5oWMypq9PYB6vJrXMOZ7dXT-S-945UGmjvdxQ1KDdEewmrRXrP-lkgyUi7vapi5xzfRtMSd_JCKeIKz6sntJ1MjvkRh-x2ocx4lKFOLY2FnnVLsOB6P6moHZ21SdVtLUmPe4yVV_I3G64NQ7gFUDcNCRJzA0_taRu2g15xc-C3Ao8KR5Q0xMMnIro_WnG488acQbnUOK3fsaKvOom5uW5DxKMKbfkQUzYam1lSePgGmCdpPJ6bhSfyIt_mrg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Fix in Cursor\" width=\"115\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"\u003e\u003c/picture\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?data=eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCIsImtpZCI6ImJ1Z2JvdC12MiJ9..GxbveQ25aXI8EmIFpZBHEDG4bj1Ry2Rk4z79f16SqTIUWX949QEi-Luzb10QAI3iTzO99b8PjuD8ACEGVT-FsKEwxNY1WBv3SJSlknE-WLe9le5KF8smpPQMJz4iuFdvE8GhvuBttq9DXRQ4ee2PGnB2pJM7Pql8LcqesJkt9c-yax1dTXbkjykcCVNTOLcG49w2XlWgyJeqhZOwjqVuuATnq0cEkMX7pcDrDUAyvGMU3pt24trcaB0fM3_8vH360RP-Fsg1a5GQ6DoTecl8YGAqG5Bi711LmQ2NlpzRDcKJFiZaXzd80-QKujgVEFoqhQtvFCR52gula2Q-5OXOrQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\"\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Fix in Web\" width=\"99\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\"\u003e\u003c/picture\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\u003csup\u003eReviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 969480642d687a41ab4441a3760656a0327790ee. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).\u003c/sup\u003e\n","created_at":"2026-04-23T06:45:34Z","html_url":"https://github.com/MetaMask/metamask-extension/pull/42009#discussion_r3128835786","id":3128835786,"line":297,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAoEEns66fj7K","path":"ui/pages/home/home.component.js","side":"RIGHT","user_type":"Bot"}
{"author":"cursor[bot]","body":"### In-app leave marker set too late to prevent redirect\n\n**High Severity**\n\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION START --\u003e\n`markPerpsUnmountInApp()` is called inside a `useEffect` cleanup (passive phase), but Home's `componentDidMount` — which reads the marker via `wasPerpsUnmountedInAppRecently(1500)` — runs during the layout phase. React guarantees layout effects (including `componentDidMount`) execute before passive effect cleanups within the same commit. So when navigating from Perps to Home in-app, the marker is never set in time, causing `checkLastVisitedPerpsRoute` to falsely redirect the user back to Perps. The cleanup containing `markPerpsUnmountInApp` needs to be a `useLayoutEffect`, not a `useEffect`, so its cleanup runs before Home's `componentDidMount`.\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION END --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 4002fbeb-e8b1-4057-bcd3-98687f3dffc5 --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- LOCATIONS START\nui/pages/perps/perps-layout.tsx#L107-L119\nui/pages/home/home.component.js#L278-L287\nLOCATIONS END --\u003e\n\u003cdetails\u003e\n\u003csummary\u003eAdditional Locations (1)\u003c/summary\u003e\n\n- [`ui/pages/home/home.component.js#L278-L287`](https://github.com/MetaMask/metamask-extension/blob/5d1913db60e983e33e6d46eb39ca9d8a5001f510/ui/pages/home/home.component.js#L278-L287)\n\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/open?data=eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCIsImtpZCI6ImJ1Z2JvdC12MiJ9..P9LgrHnHmw_F4fRhG1wU7UT_GhECXC4GZhtUVG7xzsDXQcgC_rXKGcVWp6751pkhhDcanBVl4_hw78_D6ibQT8o7eQlL7vpQck-ND25BgF4KdFluRTOLJcLfwGiIIxVQQWpKIDfBtjC1PXAPvkVXYSiu15AhYuE8T8-QmLK_NyDgls2wB8I1YmsuWA5OvybO-hjPC8VZNNfYBgFPYHpaPJBZHbGuBH-mD-IA5n_SsAKIC9OJ3Qz9HnwzfUpH6VkX2CqMPAuDd87oGp-hKd9K5H-t4x2JTd0ntVxY5ncuiVDuAGWtINVwHpvsToOYpBsmWpCiDSqH6How3imam5RDRg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-da