{"author":"cursor[bot]","body":"### Path validation fails for base `/perps` with query strings\n\n**Low Severity**\n\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION START --\u003e\nThe `isPerpsPath` check uses `path === PERPS_ROUTE || path.startsWith(`${PERPS_ROUTE}/`)`, but `PerpsLayout` stores the full path *including* query strings (e.g. `/perps?tab=1`). A stored path like `/perps?tab=1` fails both conditions — it doesn't equal `/perps` and doesn't start with `/perps/` — so the resume redirect silently doesn't fire for the base `/perps` route when query parameters are present. The validation needs to account for a `?` delimiter after the base route, or strip the query string before checking.\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION END --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: cbb23eb7-f584-4318-96fb-5671f3f29d81 --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- LOCATIONS START\nui/pages/home/home.component.js#L264-L267\nui/pages/perps/perps-layout.tsx#L98-L99\nLOCATIONS END --\u003e\n\u003cdetails\u003e\n\u003csummary\u003eAdditional Locations (1)\u003c/summary\u003e\n\n- [`ui/pages/perps/perps-layout.tsx#L98-L99`](https://github.com/MetaMask/metamask-extension/blob/4d19dbd83fa6f8b312928f0beca0ed69da043df4/ui/pages/perps/perps-layout.tsx#L98-L99)\n\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/open?data=eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCIsImtpZCI6ImJ1Z2JvdC12MiJ9..ml6QpDki6Xr5kJg_bW0eKvU7FZP8Exgv1u5LJXJt8a5t8BJAm5SElU_cPEu3VoO5XTWR7xN_Yf8Zot9q_fXLdsC5im0sAZjlX4CnpmNKfbP_DNprKUOJ3zwx0LtSP_8xr-2G16yKAZ55wxNe6UcB_mg8NFJTQObWRI9HeRngcl7mhwBd4Ima3UpQ3OyOFj9XkJO0qMNYzIQ1wBE99xDNoEGw_swfIWbg1WknbYtLiILZpRbETZ-Ghb8fwRtYdwHb3ujUEOZQH0MQ72UnBNrLfcp9P2IWtiSFPTRwFBZoYfvabDwCciqj8Lz-k-w5-GZua_V-lgHaqHfbzZ_UP3zVrA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png