{"author":"cursor[bot]","body":"### Perps redirect suppressed by non-applicable pending redirect\n\n**Low Severity**\n\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION START --\u003e\n`checkLastVisitedPerpsRoute` checks `!pendingRedirectRoute` to defer to a higher-priority redirect. However, `checkPendingRedirectRoute` runs first in `componentDidMount` and may have already determined the pending redirect doesn't apply (e.g., `environmentType` mismatch). Because `clearPendingRedirectRoute` is async, `pendingRedirectRoute` is still non-null when `checkLastVisitedPerpsRoute` reads it, incorrectly suppressing the perps redirect. Since `clearLastVisitedPerpsRoute` is then called unconditionally, the perps route is lost and neither redirect fires — the user lands on home unexpectedly.\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION END --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 7219aa18-d62b-45f9-ae23-9d1975693433 --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- LOCATIONS START\nui/pages/home/home.component.js#L280-L286\nLOCATIONS END --\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/open?data=eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCIsImtpZCI6ImJ1Z2JvdC12MiJ9..weDVDW-9IWY5jpYdE2BjjE6sNGEExZaxanV1Uo27WoWHN7yfL3uqdOE-8QzvunYfA4BX8AxSdP9RYU4cgBd48r7LjTPXC5koAYBlcVzrWteYY3TIgf9UABYgJ3N593Eos6XQ07U5b-Haxq-6slai2cDUXU6wGp5jw3mExWXEV4pAdiE-PwHciEPQNvP8NDL4PjeT0t77x0BCn6Am6hebcUX5GJ6pHhgmDwPZZCVOf2SNm4kYNzE3BfEPafVQ2iQklhVh-HqsWzIplpud2_AascevUlK_svjnUIej9d2rBlQhnyVrxOFiP1GX3TtwMUmxhu2krkpcaO_1roOMIUsZYw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Fix in Cursor\" width=\"115\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"\u003e\u003c/picture\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?data=eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR