{"author":"cursor[bot]","body":"### Unhandled promise rejection from async `startMarketDataPreload`\n\n**Medium Severity**\n\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION START --\u003e\nThe `try/catch` around `this.#controller.startMarketDataPreload()` only catches synchronous throws. If the method returns a Promise that rejects (e.g., the controller method is or becomes `async`), the rejection escapes uncaught because the return value is neither `await`ed nor `.catch()`-chained. This would produce an unhandled promise rejection that could crash the service worker in MV3. Adding `.catch()` on the return value or `await`ing inside the `try` block would cover both sync and async failure modes.\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION END --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 3a50e40a-9c11-44b8-b58f-3806e3192f4e --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- LOCATIONS START\napp/scripts/controllers/perps/perps-stream-bridge.ts#L173-L181\nLOCATIONS END --\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/open?data=eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCIsImtpZCI6ImJ1Z2JvdC12MiJ9..SbgChfZC6ZqBL1ezpyNGi7wXlCaad2ntlNcgOlhDyZH-Wx6kq4BKOC7296aVDuQqm3IgBWvTcGG9gsvluxf0Cwl3bOWzY2dEbyNKTmVoTvgwvJKOyj9rLbMq2QzsvFVLDIhu5Q5X-3pvmVn9Myqff_JG2mAx-h_JUUyrhgsh7ttHgqXbQuU9B-grhNc-eSbgdgj95Ac0Ymg7Ko-vq1ODNskCgXn1JJIGudvQQ8unvughI08Os4ExOUasD9Vz1bNh-7YqypyOxXKwz-j2ZFjeJul67od243cLlwnNztrwimd12b6FWItkwxcsTqmb6tRkL_aWwIb65quZvy8b0PDk7w\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Fix in Cursor\" width=\"115\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"\u003e\u003c/picture\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?data=eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCIsImtpZCI6ImJ1Z2JvdC12MiJ9..IIxajJyAwEtg2e1QgwZbufGR7